#==============================================================================================
#
#   selector_engine_2 - SelectorEngine: the pseudo-class helpers and matching a pseudo-class
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/SelectorEngine.cpp (lines 557-1078): the same-type sibling walks,
#       should_block_shadow_host_matching, :read-write, :open, :host, the meter's optimal-value
#       states, and matches_pseudo_class, the switch over every PseudoClass. The cases from
#       :valid on (the form validity, :required, :optional, :default, :autofill, :state() and
#       :heading) are selector_engine_3's matches_pseudo_class_forms, which this function's
#       switch calls.
